  --no-start            set up, but do not start the server
  --background          start the server in the background (log in the setup folder)
  --no-browser          do not open the browser
  --reconfigure         choose again even if a setup is already complete
  --list                list the catalog against this machine and exit
  --all                 also show the models that do not fit
  --via-windows {auto,yes,no}
