options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --yes, -y             non-interactive: take the recommendation and every default
  --model ID            catalog model to install (see --list); default: the recommendation
  --model-dir DIR       use a model already on disk instead of downloading one
  --dir DIR             folder for downloaded models (default ~/colibri-models)
  --backend {auto,cpu,vulkan,cuda}
                        engine build: auto (default) picks CUDA when the toolkit builds for the
                        card, then Vulkan, then the CPU, and a build that fails falls back to the
                        next
  --no-gpu              same as --backend cpu
  --host HOST           address to serve on (default 127.0.0.1)
  --port PORT           port to serve on (default 8000)
  --no-start            set up, but do not start the server
  --background          start the server in the background (log in the setup folder)
  --no-browser          do not open the browser
  --reconfigure         choose again even if a setup is already complete
  --list                list the catalog against this machine and exit
  --all                 also show the models that do not fit
  --via-windows {auto,yes,no}
                        WSL only: download through Windows' curl.exe (auto: when it measures
                        faster)
  --no-verify           skip the checksum of downloaded files
  --json                machine-readable result; implies --yes and a background start
